10
00:56:15,000 --> 00:56:21,000
Make It Happen is a 2008 American dance film directed by
Darren Grant and starring Mary Elizabeth Winstead.

11
01:01:52,500 --> 01:01:58,500
The screenplay was co-written by Duane Adler, who was a screenwriter
for other dance films Step Up and Save the Last Dance.

12
01:07:30,000 --> 01:07:36,000
Though the film was theatrically released internationally, the film was
released direct-to-video in the United States on December 9, 2008.

13
01:13:07,500 --> 01:13:13,500
The film received generally negative reviews, with chief criticisms being that it was yet another
by-the-numbers dance film, though Winstead's performance received significant praise.

14
01:18:45,000 --> 01:18:51,000
The film was also a commercial failure, only grossing $10 million.

15
01:24:22,500 --> 01:24:28,500
The tone is lighthearted and emotional.
